<div>
  <h3>Manchester Makerspace Household Membership Update</h3>
</div>

<div>
  <p>Hi <%= @member.fullname %>,</p>

  <% if @primary_recipient %>
    <p>Your household membership has been disbanded because your account was renewed with an individual membership plan.</p>
  <% else %>
    <p>Your household membership has been disbanded because the primary household member, <%= @primary_member.fullname %>, renewed with an individual membership plan.</p>
    <p>Please elect a new membership plan before your current expiration date to keep your membership active.</p>
  <% end %>

  <p>If you believe this was a mistake, please contact Manchester Makerspace membership support.</p>
</div>
